c:["$","p",null,{"children":"Forward-looking statements on this website include, but are not limited to, statements relating to: exploration activities and work programmes across Blocks LB-26, LB-30, and LB-31 in the Harper Basin offshore Liberia; the interpretation and reprocessing of 3D seismic data; multibeam bathymetric and geochemical seafloor surveys; the identification, delineation, and de-risking of potential drillable prospects; the commercial terms of Reconnaissance Licence RL-003 and the potential conversion thereof; anticipated capital expenditures; and future corporate milestones."}]
d:["$","p",null,{"children":"Such statements are subject to significant risks, uncertainties, and assumptions, many of which are beyond the control of BluEnergies Ltd. Exploration for hydrocarbons is a speculative venture involving high degrees of geological, technical, operational, and financial risk. Actual results, performance, or achievements may differ materially from those expressed or implied. Factors that could cause actual outcomes to differ include market conditions, commodity price fluctuations, foreign operational risks, regulatory approvals, and joint venture partner operational decisions."}]
